    <forecast>
        <area aac="SA_FA001" description="South Australia" type="region">
            <forecast-period start-time-local="2026-11-16T21:19:32+10:30" end-time-local="2026-11-16T21:19:32+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-11-16T10:49:32Z" end-time-utc="2026-11-16T10:49:32Z">
                <text type="warning_summary_footer">For latest warnings go to www.bom.gov.au, subscribe to RSS feeds, call 1300 659 210* or listen for warnings on relevant TV and radio broadcasts.</text>
                <text type="synoptic_situation">A high pressure system centred south of Western Australia, extends a ridge of high pressure over most of South Australia. The high and ridge will move slowly eastwards during the week to be in the Tasman Sea on Thursday. A low pressure system and associated trough over Western Australia will move over South Australia mid to late in the week.</text>
                <text type="product_footer">* Calls to 1300 numbers cost around 27.5c incl. GST, higher from mobiles or public phones.</text>
            </forecast-period>
        </area>
        <area aac="SA_PW010" description="West Coast" type="public-district" parent-aac="SA_FA001">
            <forecast-period index="0" start-time-local="2026-11-16T21:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-11-17T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-11-16T10:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-11-16T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Mostly clear. Winds southeasterly 20 to 30 km/h.</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="1" start-time-local="2026-11-17T00:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-11-18T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-11-16T13:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-11-17T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Partly cloudy. High chance of showers west of Ceduna, near zero chance elsewhere. The chance of a thunderstorm west of Ceduna. Winds east to southeasterly 15 to 25 km/h tending east to northeasterly 20 to 30 km/h in the morning then tending east to southeasterly 15 to 25 km/h in the late evening. Overnight temperatures falling to between 8 and 14 with daytime temperatures reaching the mid to high 20s.</text>
                <text type="fire_danger">Moderate</text>
                <text type="uv_alert">Sun protection 9:20am to 5:20pm, UV Index predicted to reach 11 [Extreme]</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="2" start-time-local="2026-11-18T00:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-11-19T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-11-17T13:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-11-18T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Cloudy. Very high chance of rain west of Ceduna, high chance elsewhere. A thunderstorm likely, possibly severe with damaging winds, large hail and heavy rain which may lead to flash flooding west of Ceduna. Winds easterly 15 to 25 km/h turning northeasterly 20 to 30 km/h during the morning. Overnight temperatures falling to between 14 and 17 with daytime temperatures reaching 25 to 31.</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="3" start-time-local="2026-11-19T00:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-11-20T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-11-18T13:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-11-19T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Partly cloudy. High chance of showers east of Ceduna, medium chance elsewhere. A thunderstorm likely in the morning and afternoon. Winds north to northeasterly 20 to 30 km/h increasing to 35 km/h before shifting west to southwesterly 20 to 30 km/h during the day, then decreasing to 15 to 20 km/h during the evening. Overnight temperatures falling to between 16 and 19 with daytime temperatures reaching 27 to 33.</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="4" start-time-local="2026-11-20T00:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-11-21T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-11-19T13:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-11-20T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Mostly sunny. Slight chance of a shower south of Streaky Bay, near zero chance elsewhere. Winds west to northwesterly 15 to 25 km/h tending west to southwesterly 20 to 30 km/h during the afternoon then tending northeast to southeasterly 15 to 20 km/h during the evening. Overnight temperatures falling to around 14 with daytime temperatures reaching 25 to 30.</text>
            </forecast-period>
        </area>
